OL,3,GNEWSAWoman stabbed 11 times by
OL,4,Aestranged husband, inquest told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman was stabbed by her estranged
OL,7,Fhusband just two days after police
OL,8,Fclosed an investigation into
OL,9,Fallegations he had poured petrol over
OL,10,Fher head and threatened to set it on
OL,11,Ffire, an inquest has heard.
OL,13,FCoventry Coroner's Court has opened a
OL,14,Fdouble inquest into the deaths of
OL,15,F49-year-old Vica Gheorghe and her
OL,16,Fhusband Marian, 52.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
