OL,3,GNEWSAWoman stabbed 11 times by
OL,4,Aestranged husband, inquest told
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe hearing was told the pair were
OL,7,Ffound wounded at the woman's home on
OL,8,FCaludon Road in the city in April 2024.
OL,9,FVic Gheorghe had been stabbed 11 times
OL,10,Fand died in hospital later that day,
OL,11,Fwhile her husband was dead at the scene
OL,12,Ffrom a stab wound to the chest.
OL,14,FOpening the proceedings, assistant
OL,15,Fcoroner Tom Leeper told the court that
OL,16,Fthe events on 5 April came two days
OL,17,Fafter Marian Gheorghe was told he would
OL,18,Fface no further police action over an
OL,19,Falleged attempt to kidnap his wife.
